8 14.1048V20.5318H124.324V0.628601H124.331Z" class="fill-color"></path><path _ngcontent-serverapp-c2031057517="" d="M148.461 14.5345C150.418 12.745 153.307 10.8656 155.494 9.3647C156.604 8.60142 157.248 7.7804 157.248 6.68999C157.248 5.4264 156.432 4.60539 154.857 4.60539C153.894 4.60539 153.224 4.86837 152.752 5.48413C152.229 6.15762 151.993 6.9209 151.993 8.24222H146.503C146.503 5.86256 146.739 4.8363 147.498 3.48291C148.607 1.4881 151.145 -0.0128174 154.971 -0.0128174C160.283 -0.0128174 163 2.77735 163 6.44625C163 8.23581 162.503 9.679 161.367 10.7951C159.384 12.7321 156.84 13.9059 154.71 15.6121V15.6698H162.885V20.5125H146.184C146.184 17.6326 146.771 16.0803 148.461 14.5217V14.5345Z" class="fill-color"></path><path _ngcontent-serverapp-c2031057517="" d="M143.143 13.1362C144.548 13.1362 145.687 11.9904 145.687 10.577C145.687 9.16355 144.548 8.01773 143.143 8.01773C141.737 8.01773 140.598 9.16355 140.598 10.577C140.598 11.9904 141.737 13.1362 143.143 13.1362Z" class="fill-color"></path></svg></div></nx-maverick-2></div><h2 _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> REDEFINING EFFICIENT PERFORMANCE <span _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">AT SCALE</span></h2><p _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""><b _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">Maverick-2 Intelligent Compute Architecture (ICA)</b> represents a revolutionary shift in computing with the unveiling of the intelligent software-defined hardware acceleration that delivers real-time adaptability and unmatched performance. This breakthrough technology is designed to deliver superior performance and efficiency for HPC, AI, and vector database applications. </p><nx-button-solid _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" invert="true" color="accent" text="discover maverick-2" arial="Discover maverick-2" _nghost-serverapp-c3613503050=""><button _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="buttun-solid --accent" aria-label="Discover maverick-2"><span _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="">discover maverick-2</span><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="__mask"></div></button></nx-button-solid></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__content"><nx-maverick-360 _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="fade-in" _nghost-serverapp-c2505628810=""><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c2505628810="" class="nx-maverick-360"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c2505628810="" class="nx-maverick-360__container"><nx-canvas-video _ngcontent-serverapp-c2505628810="" class="nx-maverick-360__video ng-star-inserted" _nghost-serverapp-c2313572599=""><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c2313572599="" class="canvas-video"><canvas _ngcontent-serverapp-c2313572599="" id="canvas" style="visibility: hidden;" class="show-on-load"></canvas><video _ngcontent-serverapp-c2313572599="" playsinline="" webkit-playsinline="" oncanplay="this.play()" onloadedmetadata="this.muted = true" autoplay="" loop=""><source _ngcontent-serverapp-c2313572599="" type="video/webm" src=""><source _ngcontent-serverapp-c2313572599="" type="video/mp4" src="assets/videos/maverick2/SpinningMaverick3.mp4"></video></div></nx-canvas-video><!----><!----></div></div></nx-maverick-360></div></div></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout nx-home-route__move-beyond-the-pain-of-porting"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container center-wrap desktop-inverted"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__header"><h2 _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">MOVE BEYOND THE PAIN OF PORTING</h2><p _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> Maverick-2 ICA pioneers a new era in HPC computing for developers. Paired with a user-friendly and powerful developer toolchain that natively supports popular languages, such as C/C++, FORTRAN, OpenMP, and Kokkos, Maverick-2 eliminates the need for domain-specific languages and the burdensome application porting effort they create. With Maverick-2 you can avoid extensive code rewrites, and accelerate your innovation while bypassing the time-consuming porting process. This software compatibility and ease of use saves months in development effort, enabling faster time-to-science and insights. NextSilicon is dedicated to providing comprehensive support for customer applications, with upcoming integrations planned for CUDA, HIP/ROCm, and leading AI frameworks. </p><nx-button-solid _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" invert="true" color="accent" text="about maverick-2" arial="learn more about maverick-2" _nghost-serverapp-c3613503050=""><button _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="buttun-solid --accent" aria-label="learn more about maverick-2"><span _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="">about maverick-2</span><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="__mask"></div></button></nx-button-solid></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__move-beyond-the-pain-of-porting__chip"><img _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" defaultimage="assets/images/maverick2/maverick2-chip.png" lazyload="assets/images/maverick2/maverick2-chip.png"></div></div><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout nx-home-route__the-future-of-acceleration-is-intelligent"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container center-wrap"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__header"><h2 _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> THE FUTURE OF ACCELERATION IS <span _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="accent-500">INTELLIGENT</span></h2><p _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> Maverick-2 is redefining the future of high-performance computing with <b _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">Intelligent Compute Architecture (ICA)</b>, a new approach that moves beyond the status quo of traditional CPU and GPU acceleration by combining intelligent software-defined hardware with real-time optimization. Maverick-2 ICA can dynamically adapt and reconfigure its hardware to the specific needs of your HPC and AI workloads to provide efficient, workload-specific performance with the flexibility to adapt to any future demands. </p><nx-button-solid _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" invert="true" color="accent" text="learn more" arial="learn more about the future of acceleration is intelligent" _nghost-serverapp-c3613503050=""><button _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="buttun-solid --accent" aria-label="learn more about the future of acceleration is intelligent"><span _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="">learn more</span><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="__mask"></div></button></nx-button-solid></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__content"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__the-future-of-acceleration-is-intelligent__canvas-loop"><nx-vimeo-video-background-loop _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" _nghost-serverapp-c2376848801="" class="ng-tns-c2376848801-5 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c2376848801="" observevisibility="" class="vimeo-video-background ng-tns-c2376848801-5"><video _ngcontent-serverapp-c2376848801="" autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="metadata" no-controls="" loop="" oncanplay="this.play()" onloadedmetadata="this.muted = true" class="ng-tns-c2376848801-5"><source _ngcontent-serverapp-c2376848801="" type="video/mp4" class="ng-tns-c2376848801-5" src="https://ns-web-media.nextsilicon.net/HOME_TECH_TechTour_Video_.mp4"></video></div></nx-vimeo-video-background-loop><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-hanger-top-left"></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-hanger-bottom-right"></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__the-future-of-acceleration-is-intelligent__canvas-loop__background"></div></div></div></div></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout nx-home-route__accelerating-sandias-vanguard-program"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container center-wrap"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__header"><h2 _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">ACCELERATING SANDIA'S VANGUARD PROGRAM</h2><mat-icon _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" role="img" svgicon="sandia" class="mat-icon notranslate nx-home-route__accelerating-sandias-vanguard-program__icon mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="svg" data-mat-icon-name="sandia"></mat-icon><p _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> In 2023, Sandia National Laboratories, leading a tri-lab consortium with <b _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory</b> (LLNL) and <b _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="">Los Alamos National Laboratory</b> (LANL), announced their partnership with NextSilicon Inc. to deliver the next Advanced Architecture Prototype System (AAPS). NextSilicon's system was embedded into Sandia’s Vanguard program and was tasked with identifying and evaluating emerging pre-tested technologies, to determine their viability in supporting the National Nuclear Security Administration's (NNSA) Advanced Simulation and Computing (ASC) program. <a _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" display="Learn more" target="_blank" href="https://www.sandia.gov/research/news/sandia-partners-with-nextsilicon-and-penguin-solutions-to-deliver-first-of-its-kind-runtime-reconfigurable-accelerator-technology/"> Learn more</a> about NextSilicon and Sandia’s partnership. </p></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__content"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__accelerating-sandias-vanguard-program__canvas-loop"><nx-vimeo-video-background-loop _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" _nghost-serverapp-c2376848801="" class="ng-tns-c2376848801-6 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c2376848801="" observevisibility="" class="vimeo-video-background ng-tns-c2376848801-6"><video _ngcontent-serverapp-c2376848801="" autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="metadata" no-controls="" loop="" oncanplay="this.play()" onloadedmetadata="this.muted = true" class="ng-tns-c2376848801-6"><source _ngcontent-serverapp-c2376848801="" type="video/mp4" class="ng-tns-c2376848801-6" src="https://ns-web-media.nextsilicon.net/home_sandia.mp4"></video></div></nx-vimeo-video-background-loop><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-hanger-top-right"></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-hanger-bottom-left"></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__accelerating-sandias-vanguard-program__canvas-loop__background"></div></div></div></div></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout nx-home-route__the-leading-risc-v-core"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container center-wrap desktop-inverted"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__header"><nx-arbel _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" color="dark" class="nx-home-route__the-leading-risc-v-core__wordmark" _nghost-serverapp-c995462495=""><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c995462495="" class="nx-arbel --dark"><img _ngcontent-serverapp-c995462495="" src="assets/images/arbel/arbel-logo.png" alt="ARBEL" class="nx-arbel__logo"></div></nx-arbel><h2 _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> THE LEADING <span _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="accent-500">RISC-V CORE</span></h2><p _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524=""> NextSilicon proudly presents its first server-class RISC-V CPU core - Arbel. Designed from the ground up on TSMC technology, Arbel is built to deliver unprecedented throughput for today's data-center workloads and beyond. </p><nx-button-solid _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" invert="true" color="accent" text="learn more" arial="learn more about arbel" _nghost-serverapp-c3613503050=""><button _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="buttun-solid --accent" aria-label="learn more about arbel"><span _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="">learn more</span><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c3613503050="" class="__mask"></div></button></nx-button-solid></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="two-rows-layout__container__content"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__the-leading-risc-v-core__chip"><img _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" defaultimage="assets/images/arbel/built-image.jpg" lazyload="assets/images/arbel/built-image.jpg" alt="Arbel processor"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-hanger-top-left"></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-hanger-bottom-right--invert"></div></div></div></div></div><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__adaptable-to-evolving-workloads"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__adaptable-to-evolving-workloads__container center-wrap"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__adaptable-to-evolving-workloads__container__header"><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" class="nx-home-route__adaptable-to-evolving-workloads__container__header__overline"><nx-maverick-2-icon _ngcontent-serverapp-c441854524="" _nghost-serverapp-c851223326=""><div _ngcontent-serverapp-c851223326="" class="maverick-2-icon" style="color: color;"><svg _ngcontent-serverapp-c851223326="" width="34" height="32" viewBox="0 0 34 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path _ngcontent-serverapp-c851223326="" d="M33.4747 6.42419V11.8058L16.7378 19.2726L0 11.8058V6.42419L16.7378 13.889L33.4747 6.42419Z" fill="url(#paint0_linear_2615_899)"></path><path _ngcontent-serverapp-c851223326="" d="M33.4747 0V5.38161L16.7378 12.8484L0 5.38161V0L16.7378 7.46482L33.4747 0Z" fill="url(#paint1_linear_2615_899)"></path><path _ngcontent-serverapp-c851223326="" d="M28.7591 14.9088L33.4737 12.8047V23.5759L16.7378 31.0427L0 23.5759V12.8047L4.71454 14.9088V20.3023H4.72644L16.7378 25.6591L28.7492 20.3023H28.7591V14.9088Z" fill="url(#paint2_linear_2615_